    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上期我们聊了莱美的A-D的课程，这次继续带你解锁F到Z的课程密码—— &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔥 </span><strong><span>新课大揭秘</span></strong><span>：Functional Strength和Strength Development有什么不同？他们如何建立运动习惯？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>💃 </span><strong><span>人设观察室</span></strong><span>：跳BodyJam像开屏花孔雀？打BodyCombat秒变闷葫芦？你的课程偏好早被性格出卖！ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚴 </span><strong><span>单车玄学现场</span></strong><span>：RPM锁鞋的魔力圈 vs 眩晕警告的The Trip未来骑行，哪款让你变成「心率过山车」？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️ </span><strong><span>血泪忠告</span></strong><span>：GRIT新手慎入Cardio（别问吐没吐），但Athletic踏板游戏能治「跳跃恐惧症」！ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有Bodystep消亡史、普拉提床平替大法、以及卷王跟教练1v1 battle的名场面… &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>莱美不是单选题</span></strong><span>——总有一门课会让你边骂边爱，变身「体能瘾君子」！点击收听，解锁你的本命课程👇 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> Functional Strength</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> Strength Development</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> Grit系列</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Strength Cadio Athletic</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">23:43</a> BODYJAM</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> BODYPUMP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2536">42:16</a> LESMILLS PILATES</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a> RPM</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3352">55:52</a> SPRINT</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3403">56:43</a> BODYSTEP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" da