    <guid isPermaLink="false">685993652a38b4d97929ad71</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 06:14:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不好意思各位，这期节目中可能会让你的耳朵不太舒服，录音的时候有些音被吃了，我们也想了一些方法补救，但是都失败了，请将就一下这部分内容。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目还是相当精彩的，因为我们拆解了健身界顶流——莱美团课的魔力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>按字母ABCD，他们分别是：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>A：BODYATTACK</span></strong><br><span>——你的「身心游乐场」！融合足球、网球等竞技动作，在跳跃与踢腿中释放压力。无需器械，用最原始的方式唤醒能量，专治现代人的精神内耗。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>B：BODYBALANCE</span></strong><br><span>——「I人本命疗愈课」！太极的流动+瑜伽的呼吸+冥想的松弛，教会你对身体说"It’s okay"。在拉伸中找回被紧绷吞噬的生命力。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>C：三门硬核体验</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>BDYCOMBAT</span></strong><span>：空击格斗哲学，每一拳都在击碎生活障碍；</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>LESMILLS CORE</span></strong><span>：剥开腹肌表象，修炼「稳定内核」的本质力量；</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>CEREMONY</span></strong><span>：循环训练新物种！4站点器械轮换，在滑雪机与划船中突破极限。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>D：LESMILLS DANCE</span></strong><br><span>——解放肢体的情绪派对！从爵士到拉丁，随热门单曲即兴舞动，让健身房变成你的私人舞池。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> BODYATTACK</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a> BODYBALANCE</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">28:53</a> BODYCOMBAT</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> LESMILLS CORE</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2831">47:11</a> LESMILLS CEREMONY</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3283">54:43</a> LESMILLS DANCE</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3432">57:12</a> 一起期待下期分享吧~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✨ 教练真心话</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>“退阶动作不是偷懒，是对身体的尊重——这里没有竞技场，只有共同生长的能量丛林。”</span></p><span>